<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estimado Equipo "Acuses" este Shipment&nbsp; ha sido&nbsp; confirmado por Monitoreo y asignado a Uds.para su </span><b><u>Verificación de Acuses</u></b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Favor de confirmar </b><font face="arial"><b>Recepción</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;de esta Solicitud y contiunar con el seguimiento.</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estatus actual:&nbsp;</span></font><font color="#006600" face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.Shipment_Status__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ff0000"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Shipment: <b>{!Shipment__c.Number__c}</b></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Order:&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>{!Customer_Quote__c.Name}</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Cliente:&nbsp;<b>{!Account.Name}</b></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Route:&nbsp;<b>{!Customer_Quote__c.Site_of_Load__c} -&nbsp;{!Customer_Quote__c.Site_of_Discharge__c}</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Verify Pak Control:&nbsp;</span><font color="#006600" face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.00N0Y00000ROZwG}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Comentarios:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
